### 2. Enhanced Functional Requirements (Consolidated & Improved)

#### A. Master Data Management (Strongly agree with your one-time setup approach)

**Improvements**:
- **Hierarchical Location Master** (Company → Site/Plant → Building → Floor → Zone/Area → Room/Line → Exact Position). Support **multi-site** from Day 1.
- **Equipment Master** + **Equipment Type Templates** (inheritance of frequency, checklist, shift rules, criticality).
- **Dynamic Checklist Engine**:
  - Support conditional questions (If pressure low → mandatory photo + comment).
  - Versioning of checklists (critical for audits).
  - Support for Pass/Fail, Numeric, Text, Multiple Choice, Signature.
- **Employee / Inspector Master**:
  - Skills matrix (Fire, Electrical, Pressure, etc.)
  - Training expiry tracking
  - Shift + Weekly off + Leave calendar integration
- **QR / RFID / NFC Management** with bulk generation & printing module.

#### B. Intelligent Scheduling Engine (The Brain)

**Core Logic (Enhanced)**:
1. **Due Date Calculation** (Frequency + Grace Period + Last Inspection + Risk Adjustment).
2. **Shift Compatibility** (Day / Night / Any + Equipment-specific constraints).
3. **Workload Balancing** (Estimated time per task + Inspector capacity + Fatigue factor).
4. **Location Clustering / Route Optimization** (Group tasks by building/floor/zone to minimize movement — use simple geospatial or graph-based grouping initially).
5. **Priority Rules** (Overdue > Critical > High Risk > Standard).
6. **Auto Re-scheduling** on failure / incomplete / rejection.

**New Industrial Features**:
- **Calendar View + Manual Override** with approval workflow.
- **What-if Simulation** ("What happens if I add 5 new operators?").
- **Preventive vs Corrective** distinction.

#### C. Inspection Execution (Mobile-First)

**Improvements**:
- **Offline-First Architecture** (Flutter + SQLite sync when online).
- **QR Scan → Auto Load Checklist + Equipment History**.
- **Reference Image + AI-assisted Photo Validation** (later phase — angle, lighting, object detection).
- **Electronic Signature** (compliant with 21 CFR Part 11).
- **GPS + Timestamp + Device Fingerprinting**.
- **Escalation Matrix** (configurable: Inspector → Supervisor → EHS Head → Plant Head with timed reminders via Email + WhatsApp + In-app).

#### D. Dashboards & Analytics

**Core Dashboards** (expand on your suggestions):
- **Compliance Scorecard** (Overall + Plant + Department wise).
